.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:49:30.145Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T22:49:31.241Z", "text": "gdi, stupid dyscalculia had me excited. "}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:2yxredrtn4vs5fqaxqbek5zd/app.bsky.feed.post/3mylaxta2g22w", "author_did": "did:plc:2yxredrtn4vs5fqaxqbek5zd", "handle": "mport25.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:45:10.769Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T22:45:12.936Z", "text": "I FUCKING HATE THIS BASKETBALL TEAM."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:r6uioffzuqu3w2s53baf6dbi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mylaxkvf7k2e", "author_did": "did:plc:r6uioffzuqu3w2s53baf6dbi", "handle": "cjeter91.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:45:02.027Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T22:45:04.446Z", "text": "Drive home safely, Milwaukee Bucks! A resilient bounce back by the Bulls"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:rv6qyyi6xegitstqezqnqfbm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mylaoxw6yk2t", "author_did": "did:plc:rv6qyyi6xegitstqezqnqfbm", "handle": "vanhaverenm.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:40:13.698Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T22:40:14.642Z", "text": "the milwaukee bucks would be 2-0 if nba games were only 3 quarters. #facts"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:mrvbh3rnv4jmde3ijv4hj4mh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mylal6r2nz25", "author_did": "did:plc:mrvbh3rnv4jmde3ijv4hj4mh", "handle": "us-med.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:38:04+00:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T22:38:06.836Z", "text": ""}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:ypklh2smar25ncblguu7ifb6/app.bsky.feed.post/3myl76qfvbs2a", "author_did": "did:plc:ypklh2smar25ncblguu7ifb6", "handle": "saint-stinky.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:13:15.211Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T22:13:17.641Z", "text": "Her ouster came after she was caught on camera causing a commotion at a Washington Wizards-Milwaukee Bucks game on Wednesday night, the same day of her promotion."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:z43tl7csrxmxmgauqawlkbx6/app.bsky.feed.post/3myl6qricc32d", "author_did": "did:plc:z43tl7csrxmxmgauqawlkbx6", "handle": "bullscourtside.bsky.social", "created_at"